# Phase identity: ambient orthorhombic Td-WTe2, Pnm21 Brown axis setting, Z=4.
# Provenance: Brown, Acta Cryst. 20, 268--274 (1966),
# doi:10.1107/S0365110X66000513; COD 2310355 (CC0):
# https://www.crystallography.net/cod/2310355.cif
# The Brown setting (a=6.282, b=3.496 A) is retained without swapping axes.
# Its six 2a sites are expanded explicitly in P1 using the source symmetries.
# The catalog B_ang2=0.6 A^2 is a modeling placeholder, not source-derived.
# Limiting checks: V=abc, W4Te8, odd 00l extinct, finite basal (002).
# Validation: wte2-td-pnm21-structure
